    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin enhances the Avada Builder Library by allowing you to upload and attach visual representations (images) to your saved templates, containers, columns, and elements. It displays these images as quick-reference icons in the library listing page with a helpful hover tooltip, making it much easier to identify items at a glance.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/ilabsys-library-preview-enhancer-for-avada</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Edit any Avada library item to add a visual representation image.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Adds a representative image/preview setup to Avada Builder Library elements both in the listing dashboard and detail pages.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin enhances the Avada Builder Library by allowing you to upload and attach visual representations (images) to your saved templates, containers, columns, and elements. It displays these images as quick-reference icons in the library listing page with a helpful hover tooltip, making it much easier to identify items at a glance.</p>\n",
